* Pure-analog NE555 behavioral model for ngspice (no XSPICE elements).
* Based on the topology of Clyde Stenson's XSPICE behavioral 555
* (ngspice forum, "XSPICE 555 Timer Model"), with the ADC/DAC bridges
* replaced by an analog cross-coupled BJT latch.
*
* Pins: GND TRIG OUT RESET CTRL THRES DISCH VCC
*
* Notes / limitations:
* - Output high side is an NPN follower (approximates the chip's ~200 mA
*   output stage). VOH is pessimistic vs a real chip (~2.6 V no-load,
*   ~1.8 V under full load here; 3.3-3.5 V measured on real parts):
*   the latch node sags under the follower's base drive through the
*   1 k/1 k path. See README "known limitation".
* - Comparator bandwidth set by genopa1 POLE (default 100k -> ~1.6us tau),
*   adding a few us of edge delay per transition.

.subckt 555a gnd trig out reset ctrl thr disch vcc
* internal divider: ctrl = 2/3 Vcc, mid = 1/3 Vcc
Rdiv1 vcc ctrl 5k
Rdiv2 ctrl mid 5k
Rdiv3 mid gnd 5k

* comparators (genopa1 output high when in+ > in-)
Xtrig mid trig vcc gnd setn genopa1      ; SET when TRIG < 1/3 Vcc
Xthr  thr ctrl vcc gnd resetn genopa1    ; RESET when THRES > 2/3 Vcc

* master reset (active low) -> rsn high when pin4 is low
Rprst reset rsi 10k
Qrst rsn rsi gnd N555
Rpu_rst rsn vcc 10k

* SR latch: outn LOW / nout HIGH  ==  Q=1 (OUT high, discharge off).
* 1k-scale resistors: the latch nodes must source both output-transistor
* base currents; at 10k scale the 1k base-drive paths pin them at ~1V.
Qa outn xba gnd N555
Qb nout xbb gnd N555
Rp1 outn vcc 1k
Rp2 nout vcc 1k
Rf1 outn xbb 1k
Rf2 nout xba 1k
Rs_set setn xba 1k
Rs_rst resetn xbb 1k
Rs_rst2 rsn xbb 1k

* discharge transistor: on when OUT low (outn high). Rdb at 10k so the
* base path does not load the outn latch node.
Rdb outn db 10k
Qd disch db gnd N555

* output stage: NPN follower high side (base from nout, which is HIGH
* when OUT should be high) + NPN pull-down driven from outn. The 100-ohm
* pull-up of the XSPICE model cannot represent a ~90 mA source load.
Rbh nout bh 1k
Qh vcc bh out N555
Rpb outn ob 1k
Qo out ob gnd N555
Routg out gnd 1Meg

.model N555 npn (is=1e-12 bf=150 ne=1.5 cje=3e-11 tf=1e-9)
.ends

* generic OpAmp model (from ngspice forum, Holger Vogt)
.subckt genopa1 in+ in- vcc vee out params: POLE=100k GAIN=20k VOFFSET=5m ROUT=10 RIN=10Meg
Rin   in+ in+ {RIN}
Voff  in+ inoff dc {VOFFSET}
G10   0 int inoff in- 100u
R1    int 0 {GAIN/100u}
C1    int 0 {1/(6.28*(GAIN/100u)*POLE)}
Eout  2 0 int 0 1
Rout  2 out {ROUT}
Elow  3 0 vee 0 1
Ehigh 8 0 vcc 0 1
Dlow  3   int Dlimit
Dhigh int 8   Dlimit
.model Dlimit D N=0.05
.ends
